+
+      <section class="about-timeline section-pad"><p class="eyebrow">Milestones</p><h2>Built rep<br />by <em>rep.</em></h2><div class="about-timeline-list"><div><span>2018</span><p>ONYX opens its first floor — one barbell wall, forty founding members, and a bell for every PR.</p></div><div><span>2020</span><p>The coaching team grows to twelve, and the recovery room becomes a permanent part of the club.</p></div><div><span>2022</span><p>10,000 members strong. Community sessions begin — open to anyone, membership or not.</p></div><div><span>2026</span><p>Today: 150+ sessions a week, four coaching disciplines, and a room that still feels like family.</p></div></div></section>
